    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Bandwidth, DMA, and errors",
      "source_hash": 7718756687790732002,
      "context_hash": 1731413765308104659,
      "translation": "대역폭, DMA, 오류",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DMA": "DMA",
        "bandwidth": "대역폭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:59.485688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "**Bandwidth reservation.** The two periodic types (interrupt and isochronous) reserve bus bandwidth when an interface or alternate setting is selected.",
      "source_hash": 14034157483027212769,
      "context_hash": 16012750258455757944,
      "translation": "**대역폭 예약.** 두 가지 주기적 전송 타입(인터럽트와 isochronous)은 인터페이스나 대체 설정(alternate setting)이 선택될 때 버스 대역폭을 예약합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bandwidth": "대역폭",
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:59.485688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "If the bus can't satisfy the request, `SET_INTERFACE`/`usb_submit_urb` **fails** rather than silently degrading — which is why a webcam may refuse a high-resolution alt-setting on a crowded bus.",
      "source_hash": 6107592883866955458,
      "context_hash": 6116308339041496148,
      "translation": "버스가 요청을 충족할 수 없으면 `SET_INTERFACE`/`usb_submit_urb`는 조용히 품질을 낮추는 대신 **실패**합니다. 혼잡한 버스에서 웹캠이 고해상도 대체 설정을 거부할 수 있는 이유가 바로 이것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:59.485689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**DMA.** `transfer_buffer` must be DMA-addressable; the HCD maps it for the [DMA engine](../mm/dma.md).",
      "source_hash": 10701865099688053021,
      "context_hash": 301699907170435241,
      "translation": "**DMA.** `transfer_buffer`는 DMA로 접근 가능해야 하며, HCD가 이를 [DMA 엔진](../mm/dma.md)용으로 매핑합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DMA": "DMA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:59.485689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "For hot paths, `usb_alloc_coherent()` hands back a buffer that's already mapped.",
      "source_hash": 12885301856832339625,
      "context_hash": 8110667938575847226,
      "translation": "핫 패스에서는 `usb_alloc_coherent()`가 이미 매핑된 버퍼를 돌려줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hot paths": "핫 패스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:40:59.485690Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Errors** arrive as a negative `urb->status`: `-EPIPE` (endpoint **stalled/halted** — cleared with `usb_clear_halt()`), `-EOVERFLOW` (**babble**: device sent more than the endpoint's max packet), `-ENOENT`/`-ECONNRESET` (URB was killed/unlinked), `-ESHUTDOWN` (the device was disconnected).",
      "source_hash": 11374041765294527431,
      "context_hash": 16310914736579747255,
      "translation": "**오류**는 음수 `urb->status`로 전달됩니다: `-EPIPE`(엔드포인트가 **stall/halt 상태**임 — `usb_clear_halt()`로 해제합니다), `-EOVERFLOW`(**babble**: 디바이스가 엔드포인트의 최대 패킷보다 많은 데이터를 보냈음), `-ENOENT`/`-ECONNRESET`(URB가 kill/unlink되었음), `-ESHUTDOWN`(디바이스 연결이 끊어졌음).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "URB": "URB",
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:36:20.745708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
